    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Đậu phụ sốt cà chua is a Vietnamese favourite of crispy "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dau-phu"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "đậu phụ "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "simmered in a sweet "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "ca-chua-sauce"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "sốt cà chua "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "tomato sauce. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "It is one of the quickest and most satisfying dishes in Vietnamese home cooking. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This recipe serves 4 alongside rice."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Frying the tofu before adding the sauce is essential. A golden crust stops it breaking apart and gives it a better texture in the sauce."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
